message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Containerised Digital Twin Platform for Evaluating Network Impacts of DER Integration"
abstract: >-
  A containerised digital twin platform for distribution networks. It generates
  per-bus load, PV, battery and EV profiles for any uploaded network, solves
  single- or multi-day quasi-static time-series (QSTS) power flow on MV/LV
  feeders behind a solver-agnostic bus contract (OpenDSS or PSS SINCAL),
  coordinates demand response across per-prosumer shadow twins, and models the
  Australian regulatory mechanisms governing DER export (AS/NZS 4777.2 inverter
  responses and CSIP-Aus dynamic operating envelopes).
type: software
